<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>5 参考 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/</link><description>Recent content in 5 参考 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 21:01:20 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>5.1 CLI 参考</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.1-cli/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:02:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.1-cli/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/cli/"&gt;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/cli/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="cli-reference"&gt;CLI Reference&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="uv"&gt;uv&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An extremely fast Python package manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="usage"&gt;Usage&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv [OPTIONS] &amp;lt;COMMAND&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 id="commands"&gt;Commands&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv auth&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Manage authentication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv run&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Run a command or script&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv init&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Create a new project&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv add&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Add dependencies to the project&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv remove&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Remove dependencies from the project&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv version&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Read or update the project&amp;rsquo;s version&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv sync&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Update the project&amp;rsquo;s environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv lock&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Update the project&amp;rsquo;s lockfile&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv export&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
Export the project&amp;rsquo;s lockfile to an alternate format&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5.2 设置</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.2-settings/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:02:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.2-settings/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/settings/"&gt;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/settings/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="settings"&gt;Settings&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="project-metadata"&gt;Project metadata&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="build-constraint-dependencies"&gt;&lt;code&gt;build-constraint-dependencies&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constraints to apply when solving build dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build constraints are used to restrict the versions of build dependencies that are selected when building a package during resolution or installation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Including a package as a constraint will &lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt; trigger installation of the package during a build; instead, the package must be requested elsewhere in the project&amp;rsquo;s build dependency graph.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;注意&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In &lt;code&gt;uv lock&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;uv sync&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;uv run&lt;/code&gt;, uv will only read &lt;code&gt;build-constraint-dependencies&lt;/code&gt; from the &lt;code&gt;pyproject.toml&lt;/code&gt; at the workspace root, and will ignore any declarations in other workspace members or &lt;code&gt;uv.toml&lt;/code&gt; files.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5.3 环境变量</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.3-environment/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:02:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.3-environment/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/environment/"&gt;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/environment/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="environment-variables"&gt;Environment variables&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;uv defines and respects the following environment variables:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="uv_astral_mirror_url"&gt;&lt;code&gt;UV_ASTRAL_MIRROR_URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;自 &lt;code&gt;0.11.14&lt;/code&gt; 起新增&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Replaces the &lt;code&gt;https://releases.astral.sh&lt;/code&gt; base URL for all Astral-mirrored metadata and artifact downloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When set, uv uses only the configured mirror URL and does not fall back to GitHub or raw GitHub. Path components in the URL are preserved: only trailing slashes are trimmed before appending the normal path suffix (e.g., &lt;code&gt;/github/versions/main/v1/uv.ndjson&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5.4 存储</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.4-storage/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:02:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.4-storage/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/storage/"&gt;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/storage/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="54-存储"&gt;5.4 存储&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="存储目录"&gt;存储目录&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;uv 使用以下高层目录进行存储。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;对于每个位置，uv 会按给定顺序检查环境变量是否存在，并使用找到的第一个路径。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;存储目录的路径与平台相关。uv 在 Linux 和 macOS 上遵循 &lt;a href="https://specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir-spec/latest/"&gt;XDG&lt;/a&gt; 约定，在 Windows 上遵循 &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/shell/known-folders"&gt;Known Folder&lt;/a&gt; 方案。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5.5 安装器选项</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.5-installer/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:02:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/uv/reference/5.5-installer/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
